    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A magical familiar bonded with you when you were young and stayed by your side as you grew up. Now you can't imagine life without your furry—or feathered, scaly, or slimy—companion. You have learned to work hand in hand with your familiar, and when adventure turns hard, it is quick to remind you of life's small joys.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.az44pZCPz6PYU23k]{Familiar Friend}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Animal Handling and Arcana</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepQuartersta]{Quarterstaff}, Gaming Set (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBell0000000]{Bell}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagString00000]{String}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 44 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
